RemoveCollateralTest
├── given market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given assets is zero
│   └── it should revert
├── given onBehalf is zero address
│   └── it should revert
├── given sender is not authorized for onBehalf
│   └── it should revert
└── given assets is greater than zero
    ├── when user has insufficient collateral
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when removing collateral makes position insolvent
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when user has sufficient collateral
        ├── when receiver is authorized callback
        │   ├── when data is provided
        │   │   └── it should remove collateral and call callback
        │   └── when no data is provided
        │       └── it should remove collateral
        └── when receiver is not authorized callback
            ├── when data is provided
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when no data is provided
                └── it should remove collateral 